      "observations": [
        "One shared coordinate frame, not separate panels. Positive x points right, positive y upward; O is beside the central axes crossing.",
        "A solid positive-slope diagonal runs from the lower-left frame corner to the upper-right corner through the origin; y=x is set along that line above/right of the circle.",
