        "Fine horizontal hatches cover the half-plane above/left of the diagonal, to the frame; fine vertical hatches fill the disk and stop at its circumference.",
        "Both hatch systems coexist in the upper-left half of the disk. The lower-right disk half has vertical hatches only; the upper-left area outside the disk has horizontal hatches only; the lower-right exterior has neither.",
